# Email generation

Every outbound email must pass validation. Every personalized professor claim needs stored supporting evidence.

Personalization must change the opening paragraph, the research-interest paragraph, and the internal relevance explanation. Do not only swap the professor name.

Do not mention relevance scores, URLs, or citations in the email body. Do not use em dashes. Do not claim the student read a paper unless that evidence exists.

Review Mode is the default. Autopilot may send only when every quality gate passes.
